Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.00,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Moon, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Watashi wa nannen nemutte ita no da?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}How many years have I slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Dare ga watashi o okoshita no da?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Who awakened me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.78,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Tsukiyo, oshiete kure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.78,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Moon, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Mata wazawai ga chikazuite iru no ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Is calamity approaching again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.12,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Naraba, ware ni chikara o ataeyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.12,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Then grant me power!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Omae wa dare da.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.54,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.31,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Nani shi ni kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.31,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:46.36,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Yahari omae ga watashi o okoshita no da na.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:46.36,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}So it was you who woke me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.86,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Yokubari no oji me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:47.86,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}You greedy prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.39,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Hakugin no numa ni wa ippo mo chikazukasenu zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.39,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}I won't let you get a single step closer to the Silver Swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.69,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Onore yokubari ningen me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.69,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Curse you, greedy human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:40.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Mun-ku Tsuki yo... tsuki yo... watashi o tasukero...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:40.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}O Moon, O Moon, O moon, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:44.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Watashi ni chikara o ataeyo ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:44.88,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Will you give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.42,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Tsuki yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.42,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}O Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:10.24,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Nani sawaru denai ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:10.24,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Do not touch that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Kono fune wa watasanu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.16,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}I will not hand over this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:16.32,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Omae ni wa ano yokubari no ou no oroka na chi ga nagarete iru!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:16.32,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}The foolish blood of that greedy king flows in your veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Watashi wa suuhyakunen kono fune o mamotte kita gin no sei da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.74,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}I am the Silver Spirit, guardian of this ship for centuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.80,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Damare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.80,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.79,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Omae no sosen no oroka na ou mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.79,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Your foolish ancestor said the same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:48.66,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}sonna koto o itte gin o hitorijime ni shiyou to shita no da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:48.66,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}trying to keep all the silver for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:50.18,Silver Knight / Spirit Romaji - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Sono tame ni,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:50.18,Silver Knight / Spirit Translation - 32 sapphire's treasure,,0,0,0,fx,{\fnVerdana\b1\fs45\3c&H990000&\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad1\blur1\t(0,300,\blur2.5\3c&HFFEA00&)\t(300,600,\blur1\3c&H990000&)}Because of that,
